b\". Savor the Flavor, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Mar 2010. Archived by the Internet Archive."}},{"id":"savor-flavor-booster-quest-shamans-orb-2010-03-23-e2","era":null,"summary":"The protagonist blasts a hole in the dragon's wing; it flees and buildings burn.","participants":["the-player-planeswalker","mordant-dragon"],"location":"sea-gate","importance":"minor","page":"archive/savor-flavor-booster-quest-shamans-orb-2010-03-23","order":240,"story_date":"2010-03-23","storyline":"Rise of the Eldrazi","source":"wizards-archive","paragraph":18,"quote":"Your blast of electrical mayhem tore a nasty hole right through the dragon's wing membrane.","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220809131218/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/booster-quest-shamans-orb-2010-03-23#:~:text=Your%20blast%20of%20electrical,the%20dragon%27s%20wing%20membrane.","citation":{"source":"wizards-archive","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Booster Quest: The Shaman's Orb","series":"Savor the Flavor","authors":[],"date":"2010-03-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/booster-quest-shamans-orb-2010-03-23","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220809131218/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/booster-quest-shamans-orb-2010-03-23#:~:text=Your%20blast%20of%20electrical,the%20dragon%27s%20wing%20membrane.","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220809131218/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/booster-quest-shamans-orb-2010-03-23","license":null,"text":"\"Booster Quest: The Shaman's Orb\". Savor the Flavor, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Mar 2010. Archived by the Internet Archive."}},{"id":"savor-flavor-booster-quest-shamans-orb-2010-03-23-e3","era":null,"summary":"The protagonist and minotaur find the dragon enchanted and defeat it.","participants":["the-player-planeswalker","minotaur-of-the-labyrinth","mordant-dragon"],"location":"zendikar","importance":"major","page":"archive/savor-fla